#!/bin/sh
# scripts/tool NAME [ARGS]...: run the program NAME of the package NAME, built by repkgs or
# packages/ (an output packages.<system>.NAME of default.nix), through scripts/tools.sh. For the
# tools the dev shell does not carry:
#   scripts/tool hcloud server list
set -eu
[ $# -ge 1 ] || { echo "usage: scripts/tool NAME [ARGS]..." >&2; exit 2; }
SCRIPT_DIR="$(dirname "$(realpath "$0")")"
. "$SCRIPT_DIR/tools.sh"
name=$1
shift
bin=$(tools_path "$(dirname "$SCRIPT_DIR")" "$name") || exit 1
exec "$bin/$name" "$@"
